Value SOFTWARE_VERSION (\S+)
Value RELEASE (.+?)
Value DEVICE (\S+)
Value UPTIME (.+?)
Value LAST_REBOOT_REASON (.+?)
Value BOOT_IMAGE (\S+)
Value SYSTEM_IMAGE (\S+)
Value HARDWARE_VERSION (\S+)

Start
  ^H3C\s+Comware\s+Software,\s+Version\s+${SOFTWARE_VERSION},\s+${RELEASE}\s*$$
  ^H3C\s+${DEVICE}\s+uptime\s+is\s+${UPTIME}\s*$$
  ^Last\s+reboot\s+reason\s*:\s*${LAST_REBOOT_REASON}\s*$$
  ^Boot\s+image:\s+${BOOT_IMAGE}\s*$$
  ^System\s+image:\s+${SYSTEM_IMAGE}\s*$$
  ^Hardware\s+Version\s+is\s+${HARDWARE_VERSION}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^Copyright.*$$
  ^\s*$$
